WEBVTT

00:07:30.436 --> 00:07:33.756
Expanding recognition of the land rights
of Indigenous peoples

00:07:33.756 --> 00:07:36.956
is an effective and moral solution

00:07:36.996 --> 00:07:38.516
for protecting our world.

00:07:38.916 --> 00:07:40.156
And protecting the land

00:07:40.196 --> 00:07:44.036
can be done only together
with the people living on it,

00:07:44.076 --> 00:07:48.476
like Canada is doing with its Indigenous,
Protected and Conserved Areas.

00:07:50.356 --> 00:07:51.876
Some will say, however,

00:07:51.916 --> 00:07:55.116
that we cannot afford
to protect our natural world.

00:07:56.196 --> 00:07:58.116
Well, let's look at the numbers.

00:07:58.876 --> 00:08:01.836
A study has put the cost
of protecting 30 percent of the planet